.github/antigravity.md
.github/instructions/
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.yarn/install-state.gz

# Compiled ARM output. `az bicep build` without --stdout writes <name>.json beside the
# source, so a local run of the CI compile step drops one of these in the tree. It is a build
# artifact of the .bicep next to it and committing it creates a second, silently stale copy of
# the estate — one that kept declaring an availability test after the .bicep had dropped it.
azure/**/*.json
